# No API keys or paid services are required for the local MLX provider.
# The CLI reads environment variables; it does not automatically load .env files.
# Override optional model download cache location (defaults to this project's .models/):
# HF_HOME=/absolute/path/to/private/model-cache
# Optional identifying User-Agent for source requests (never include credentials):
# PORTLAND_BRIEF_USER_AGENT=PortlandDailyBrief/0.1 (local personal research)
